msgid "Off"
msgstr "Apagada"

msgid "Off, it is saved but nobody sees it."
msgstr "Apagado, se guarda pero nadie lo ve."

msgid "Off. People come in without confirming."
msgstr "Apagada. La gente entra sin confirmar."

msgid "On"
msgstr "Encendida"

msgid "On / off"
msgstr "Encender / apagar"

msgid "On for every form. It avoids fake addresses."
msgstr "Encendida para todos los formularios. Evita direcciones falsas."

msgid "One click and you are in"
msgstr "Un clic y estás dentro"

msgid "One email a month, no filler"
msgstr "Un correo al mes, sin relleno"

msgid "Only active subscribers. Whoever is on two lists receives it once. With no list checked, it goes to everyone."
msgstr "Solo suscriptores activos. Quien esté en dos listas la recibe una vez. Sin ninguna lista marcada, va a todos."

msgid "Only blog posts"
msgstr "Solo las entradas del blog"

msgid "Only from 100 subscribers on (now %s)."
msgstr "Solo a partir de 100 suscriptores (ahora %s)."

msgid "Only sent campaigns can be resent."
